---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { FileText, AlertTriangle, ShieldCheck } from '@lucide/astro';

export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions — Welfare Hospital, Agra"
  description="Terms and conditions governing website use, outpatient consultation scheduling, and patient visits at Welfare Hospital, Ram Bagh, Agra."
>
  <section class="bg-hospital-navy text-white py-14 relative">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-3">
        Terms of Service & Outpatient Conditions
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
        Effective Date: January 1, 2026 &bull; Welfare Hospital, 100 Feet Road, Ram Bagh, Agra
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-white text-hospital-body">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 space-y-10 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-hospital-navy mb-3">1. Scope of Digital Portal</h2>
        <p>
          This website serves as an informational platform and an outpatient appointment request channel for Welfare Hospital, supervised by Dr. Opee Rajput. The submission of an online request registers your preferred date and time slot with our reception desk. It does not constitute a guaranteed clinical reservation until confirmed by our hospital staff.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-hospital-navy mb-3">2. Outpatient Care & Emergency Advisory</h2>
        <p>
          Welfare Hospital provides general medical outpatient care and physician consultations. <strong>This website is not an emergency response hotline.</strong> If you or an individual in your care experiences severe chest pain, acute breathing distress, profound trauma, or life-threatening symptoms, please report immediately to the nearest tertiary trauma center or dial emergency medical services (108 / 112).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-hospital-navy mb-3">3. Doctor Consultation & Timings</h2>
        <p>
          Consultation slots are subject to physician availability during standard OPD operating hours (Monday to Saturday: Morning 10:00 AM &ndash; 01:00 PM and Evening 05:00 PM &ndash; 08:00 PM). In circumstances of clinical emergencies or urgent patient care, appointment timings may experience slight scheduling adjustments.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-hospital-navy mb-3">4. Accuracy of Patient Information</h2>
        <p>
          Patients submitting consultation requests are responsible for providing an active, reachable 10-digit Indian phone number. Failure to provide accurate contact information may prevent our front desk from confirming your consultation ticket.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-hospital-navy mb-3">5. Intellectual Property & Brand Usage</h2>
        <p>
          All trademarks, clinical descriptions, hospital identifiers, layout designs, and imagery associated with Welfare Hospital are proprietary assets. Unauthorized copying, scraping, or misuse is strictly prohibited under applicable Indian law.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-hospital-navy mb-3">6. Governing Jurisdiction</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms of Service are governed by the laws of India. Any legal dispute or claim arising in connection with website services shall fall under the exclusive jurisdiction of the competent courts in Agra, Uttar Pradesh.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
